const stages=[['target','目标解析'],['scope','Scope'],['surface','攻击面'],['analysis','自动分析'],['processing','数据处理'],['verification','漏洞验证'],['impact','影响判断'],['report','报告']];
const state={mode:localStorage.getItem('src-mode')||'traditional',engagements:[],runs:[],findings:{verified:[],candidates:[]},coverage:[],activeRun:null,runDetails:null,pending:[],runReport:null,taskCenter:{counts:{},items:[]},httpExchanges:[],httpSelected:null,propertyReplay:{},launch:null,poll:null};
const esc=v=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
async function api(path,options={}){const r=await fetch(path,{headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},...options});let d;try{d=await r.json()}catch{d={detail:`HTTP ${r.status}`}}if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.detail||'请求失败');return d}
function toast(msg){const e=$('#toast');e.textContent=msg;e.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(e.timer);e.timer=setTimeout(()=>e.classList.remove('show'),2600)}
const workspaceMeta={new:['01','新建分析','定义目标与授权边界'],run:['02','分析过程','跟踪执行、证据与阻塞'],findings:['03','漏洞结果','审阅候选并完成独立复验'],reports:['04','报告中心','从已验证事实编译交付材料'],settings:['05','设置与工具','检查本机能力与安全边界']};
function updateWorkspaceContext(name){const meta=workspaceMeta[name]||workspaceMeta.new;$('#contextIndex').textContent=meta[0];$('#contextTitle').textContent=meta[1];$('#contextHint').textContent=meta[2];const current=['new','run','findings','reports'].indexOf(name);$$('[data-context-step]').forEach((item,index)=>{item.classList.toggle('active',item.dataset.contextStep===name);item.classList.toggle('done',current>index)});$('#contextMode').textContent=state.mode==='web3'?'Web3 / Immunefi':'传统 SRC';const active=state.runs.filter(r=>['queued','running','paused'].includes(r.status)).length;$('#contextTaskFact').textContent=`${active} 个活动任务`}
function go(name){$$('.workspace').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.workspace===name));$$('.nav-link').forEach(x=>{x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.go===name);if(x.dataset.go===name)x.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else x.removeAttribute('aria-current')});window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});history.replaceState(null,'',name==='new'?'/new':`/${name}`);updateWorkspaceContext(name);$('#workspace').focus({preventScroll:true});if(name==='settings'&&window.settingsEnhancerReady)loadTools();if(name==='run'){renderRun();loadCoverage();loadHttpWorkbench()}}
$$('[data-go]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>go(b.dataset.go));
document.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(!event.metaKey&&!event.ctrlKey)return;const tag=document.activeElement?.tagName;if(['INPUT','TEXTAREA','SELECT'].includes(tag))return;const target=['new','run','findings','reports','settings'][Number(event.key)-1];if(target){event.preventDefault();go(target)}});
function setMode(mode){state.mode=mode;state.activeRun=null;state.runDetails=null;state.runReport=null;state.findings={verified:[],candidates:[]};state.propertyReplay={};localStorage.setItem('src-mode',mode);$$('[data-mode]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.mode===mode));const web3=mode==='web3';$('#modeLede').textContent=web3?'输入已获授权的合约、协议或代码仓库。生产网保持只读，写入只允许 local fork / devnet。':'输入已获授权的网站或代码仓库。系统先冻结 Scope，再安排分析、复验和报告。';$('#targetInput').placeholder=web3?'0x 合约地址、协议或仓库地址':'https://app.example.com 或代码仓库地址';$('#web3LaunchConfig').hidden=!web3;$('#sourcePathHint').textContent=web3?'链上地址必须填写 Solidity 源码目录；仓库 URL 可由系统检出。':'填写后使用 Semgrep、Gitleaks 与 Trivy；不需要 Docker。';$('#useNativeAgent').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#allowSubdomains').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#allowPassiveThirdParty').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#allowOast').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#allowAuthentication').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#allowReversibleState').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#allowConcurrencyTesting').closest('label').hidden=web3;$('#oastHostsField').hidden=web3||!$('#allowOast').checked;$('#authHostsField').hidden=web3||!$('#allowAuthentication').checked;$('#stateEnvironmentField').hidden=web3||(!$('#allowReversibleState').checked&&!$('#allowConcurrencyTesting').checked);renderFindings();renderRun();$('#runSummary').innerHTML='<div class="empty-state">选择一次运行以查看总结。</div>';$('#runReportPanel').innerHTML='<div class="empty-state">当前工作域暂无运行报告。</div>';$('#downloadRunReport').disabled=true;refresh()}
$$('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setMode(b.dataset.mode));
$$('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>updateWorkspaceContext(location.pathname.split('/')[1]==='runs'?'run':location.pathname.split('/')[1]||'new')));
const authOption=document.createElement('label');authOption.className='option-card';authOption.innerHTML='<input id="allowAuthentication" type="checkbox"><span><b>允许测试账号登录</b><small>使用隔离可见 Chrome 采集测试会话，不读取日常浏览器资料</small></span>';$('#allowOast').closest('label').after(authOption);const authHostsField=document.createElement('label');authHostsField.id='authHostsField';authHostsField.hidden=true;authHostsField.innerHTML='登录流程附加域名（每行一个）<textarea id="authAllowedHosts" rows="3" placeholder="sso.research.example"></textarea><small>目标主域自动允许；第三方 SSO、静态资源或认证 API 域名必须在此冻结。</small>';$('#oastHostsField').after(authHostsField);
const stateOption=document.createElement('label');stateOption.className='option-card';stateOption.innerHTML='<input id="allowReversibleState" type="checkbox"><span><b>允许可回滚状态测试</b><small>仅限本地夹具、临时测试环境或生产克隆；每次执行仍需单独确认</small></span>';authOption.after(stateOption);const concurrencyOption=document.createElement('label');concurrencyOption.className='option-card';concurrencyOption.innerHTML='<input id="allowConcurrencyTesting" type="checkbox"><span><b>允许有界并发测试</b><small>仅限隔离环境的只读步骤；用于竞态与不一致读假设</small></span>';stateOption.after(concurrencyOption);const stateEnvironmentField=document.createElement('label');stateEnvironmentField.id='stateEnvironmentField';stateEnvironmentField.hidden=true;stateEnvironmentField.innerHTML='隔离环境类型<select id="stateEnvironment"><option value="local_fixture">本地夹具</option><option value="ephemeral_test">临时测试环境</option><option value="staging_clone">生产数据脱敏克隆</option></select><small>生产环境和公共测试目标永远不能执行状态变更或并发探测。</small><span>最大并发数<input id="concurrencyLimit" type="number" min="2" max="5" value="2"></span>';authHostsField.after(stateEnvironmentField);
const importButton=document.createElement('button');importButton.id='openTargetImport';importButton.type='button';importButton.className='quiet-button target-import-button';importButton.textContent='导入 OpenAPI / Postman / HAR';$('#targetHint').after(importButton);const importDialog=document.createElement('dialog');importDialog.id='targetImportDialog';importDialog.className='target-import-dialog';importDialog.innerHTML='<div class="dialog-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL TARGET IMPORT</p><h2>导入接口目标包</h2><p>文件只在本机解析。系统仅保留方法、去查询参数 URL 与来源哈希，不保存 Header、Cookie、Body 或变量值。</p></div><button type="button" class="close-button" aria-label="关闭">×</button></div><form id="targetImportForm"><label>选择文件<input id="targetImportFile" type="file" accept=".json,.yaml,.yml,application/json,text/yaml" required></label><label>项目名称<input id="targetImportName" required minlength="2" placeholder="例如：订单 API 接口包"></label><button type="submit" class="primary-action compact"><span>安全预览</span><b>→</b></button></form><section id="targetImportPreview" hidden></section><p id="targetImportError" class="inline-error" role="alert"></p>';document.body.append(importDialog);let targetImportContent='',targetImportKind='auto';importButton.onclick=()=>{if(state.mode!=='traditional')return toast('接口目标包当前用于 Traditional 工作域');$('#targetImportPreview').hidden=true;$('#targetImportError').textContent='';importDialog.showModal()};importDialog.querySelector('.close-button').onclick=()=>importDialog.close();$('#targetImportForm').onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();const file=$('#targetImportFile').files[0];if(!file)return;try{targetImportContent=await file.text();const preview=await api('/api/v1/target-packages/preview',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({kind:'auto',content:targetImportContent})});targetImportKind=preview.kind;const panel=$('#targetImportPreview');panel.hidden=false;panel.innerHTML=`<div class="import-summary"><strong>${esc(preview.kind.toUpperCase())}</strong><span>${preview.counts.endpoints} 个端点 · ${preview.counts.origins} 个来源</span></div><fieldset><legend>选择冻结根目标</legend>${preview.origins.map((item,index)=>`<label><input type="radio" name="importRoot" value="${esc(item.origin)}" ${index===0?'checked':''}><span><b>${esc(item.origin)}</b><small>${item.requests} 个请求${item.default_in_scope?' · 默认进入 Scope':' · 默认排除'}</small></span></label>`).join('')}</fieldset><p>${esc(preview.boundary)}</p><button type="button" id="applyTargetImport" class="primary-action compact"><span>建立草稿并审阅 Scope</span><b>→</b></button>`;$('#applyTargetImport').onclick=async()=>{try{const root=importDialog.querySelector('input[name="importRoot"]:checked')?.value,result=await api('/api/v1/target-packages/apply',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({kind:targetImportKind,content:targetImportContent,name:$('#targetImportName').value.trim(),root_target:root})});importDialog.close();state.pending=[result.engagement];$('#scopeState').textContent=`已导入 ${result.import.in_scope_endpoints} 个根目标端点 · 等待确认`;showScope(state.pending);await refresh();toast('目标包已安全导入，确认 Scope 后才能运行')}catch(error){$('#targetImportError').textContent=error.message}}}catch(error){$('#targetImportError').textContent=error.message}};
$('#advancedToggle').onclick=()=>{const p=$('#advancedPanel');p.hidden=!p.hidden;$('#advancedToggle span').textContent=p.hidden?'+':'−';$('#advancedToggle').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!p.hidden))};$('#expertToggle').onclick=()=>$('#expertPanel').hidden=!$('#expertPanel').hidden;$('#expertMode').onclick=()=>$('#expertSettings').hidden=!$('#expertSettings').hidden;$('#refreshTools').onclick=loadTools;
